After a while of launching ... we decided to slightly change the direction of VQD!

What has been changed:

Trailer, game images, logo and advertising images;
Game description;
Before the game had a crazy theme, now it is more sober and happy, changing almost the whole look of the game;
Enemies' lives and weapon damage were all readjusted;
Many songs have been changed for a better experience;

What was added:

Particles in player;
new skins menu, and new weapons menu;
7 new swords;

Bugs fixed:

Acid collision without actually colliding;
